      "depth": 1,
      "tags": [
        "fun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dkm3",
      "text": "When I have news, I:",
      "type": "THIS_OR_THAT",
      "depth": 1,
      "options": [
        "Tell you first",
        "Sit on it for a day"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "words"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dkm4",
      "text": "What do I do when I am stressed and do not want to say so?",
      "type": "PICK_ONE",
      "depth": 2,
      "options": [
        "Clean something",
        "Go very quiet",
        "Get extremely busy",
        "Snack"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "acts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dkm5",
      "text": "How much do I care what other people think of us?",
